  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water4Life: Hand Pump for Drinking water in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an undeniable fact that water is life, 60% of human bodies are water. Therefore, it is important to ensure that our water must be clean and safe to drink. Nepal has faced many crises in the short period of time. However, one of Nepal&apos;s most pressing crises is the problem of access to clean water. The Importance of water in Islam: It was narrated that Sa&apos;ad bin Ubadah Said: &quot;I said: O messenger of Allah, what kinds of charity is best?&apos; He said: &apos;providing drinking water.&apos;&quot; R:an-nasai 3664</narrative>
  </description>
